      ],
      "text": "engagement of adherence counsellors and social workers and peer support for early recognition of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.426513671875,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "adverse events and to support retention and adherence to co-treatment are also needed, as well as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        324.2104187011719,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "for continuation of ART after TB treatment completion.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4190063476562,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review evaluating the effectiveness of delivering ART in TB treatment settings identified",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.3883056640625,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "19 observational studies, many of which showed increased uptake and timeliness of ART initiation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.4376831054688,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "However, the data on mortality and TB treatment success were inconsistent. The same systematic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.4257202148438,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "review identified five observational studies evaluating the effectiveness of delivering TB treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.44189453125,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "in HIV care settings. Two studies reported decreased mortality, and another showed comparable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4215698242188,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "mortality rates. The TB treatment success rates and ART uptake were comparable across studies  .  (44)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.12161254882812,
        221.35906982421875,
        247.30661010742188
      ],
      "text": "3.3\t HIV prevention",
