        265.056396484375,
        194.8867950439453,
        284.63140869140625
      ],
      "text": "3.3.1\t Background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.3814697265625,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "Whilst there are no recommendations on HIV prevention among people with presumptive and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4288940429688,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed TB that have been assessed using the GRADE methodology, programmatic guidance was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.4234008789062,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "developed as part of the development of the  , as  WHO policy on collaborative TB/HIV activities (10)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        175.19998168945312,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "listed below in Box 3.1.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
