        76.535400390625,
        384.96112060546875,
        490.5951232910156,
        399.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "Box 3.1.   Guidance on HIV prevention interventions for people with presumptive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55909729003906,
        397.9391174316406,
        244.00341796875,
        412.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "(10) and diagnosed TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        432.9681091308594,
        515.6621704101562,
        445.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "TB programmes should implement comprehensive HIV prevention strategies for people attending",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.54329681396484,
        434.3456115722656,
