      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        443.4681091308594,
        515.58349609375,
        455.9416198730469
      ],
      "text": "TB care and their partners, targeting sexual, parenteral or vertical transmission or should establish a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        453.9681091308594,
        299.7529296875,
        466.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "referral linkage with HIV programmes to do so.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        465.8854064941406,
        515.6822509765625,
        478.3589172363281
      ],
      "text": "HIV programmes and TB programmes should implement procedures to ensure access to voluntary,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.54329681396484,
        467.2629089355469,
        103.67979431152344,
        477.8078918457031
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        476.3854064941406,
        515.6576538085938,
        488.8589172363281
      ],
      "text": "acceptable and confidential HIV testing services for healthcare providers and for reduction of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        486.8854064941406,
        397.7738952636719,
        499.3589172363281
      ],
      "text": "occupational and nosocomial exposure to HIV infection in their services.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        498.8027038574219,
        515.696533203125,
        511.2762145996094
      ],
      "text": "All personnel working with people with presumptive and diagnosed TB, people living with HIV and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.54329681396484,
        500.1802062988281,
        103.67979431152344,
        510.7251892089844
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        509.3027038574219,
        515.6754150390625,
        521.7761840820312
      ],
      "text": "people who use drugs should be able to assess risk factors for HIV infection and transmission and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        519.8026733398438,
        482.43975830078125,
        532.2761840820312
      ],
      "text": "should provide comprehensive information and services to their clients to minimize their risks.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        531.719970703125,
        515.6347045898438,
        544.1934814453125
      ],
      "text": "HIV programmes and TB programmes should collaborate with harm reduction services to ensure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.54329681396484,
        533.0974731445312,
        103.67979431152344,
        543.6425170898438
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        542.219970703125,
        515.6593627929688,
        554.6934814453125
      ],
      "text": "universal access to comprehensive TB and HIV prevention, diagnosis, treatment and care as well as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        552.719970703125,
        515.64501953125,
        565.1934814453125
      ],
      "text": "drug treatment services, including opioid agonist maintenance therapy for people who use drugs, in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        563.219970703125,
        515.6614990234375,
        575.6934814453125
      ],
      "text": "a holistic person-centred approach to maximize access and adherence within one setting as much as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        573.719970703125,
        149.98348999023438,
        586.1934814453125
      ],
      "text": "possible.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        586.1593017578125,
        515.4755249023438,
        597.976318359375
      ],
      "text": "TB programmes should ensure that all pregnant women living with HIV who attend TB services are referred",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.54329681396484,
        587.4642944335938,
        103.14630126953125,
        597.4542846679688
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.22049713134766,
        596.6593017578125,
        323.0107116699219,
        608.476318359375
      ],
      "text": "to services for prevention of vertical transmission of HIV.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.4443969726562,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "WHO’s  Consolidated guidelines on HIV prevention, testing, treatment, service delivery and monitoring:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.41943359375,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "recommend combination HIV  recommendations for a public health approach, 2021 update (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.4222412109375,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "prevention programmes, which use a mix of evidence-based biomedical, behavioural and structural",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4212036132812,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "interventions to have the greatest possible impact on reducing the number of people newly infected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.4376220703125,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "with HIV, designed according to the local HIV epidemiology and context. These approaches are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.4111328125,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "also relevant for people with TB and their contacts who are at risk of, or living with, HIV. This section",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.3823852539062,
        527.4278564453125,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "provides a brief overview of key HIV prevention considerations. Detailed guidance is published in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
